# Captured over RF from a physical EV1 2K card with a Proxmark3 after
# FormatPICC. The PICC key is the all-zero test key. The recorder verified the
# card's final authentication proof and the response MAC. Configuration 00/00
# leaves the card's format and random-ID settings unchanged.
name: physical EV1 2K protected PICC configuration
case-id: hardware-genuine-ev1-2k-configuration
origin: physical-card
source: Proxmark3 RF capture, physical EV1 2K
requires: ev1,auth-iso
uid: 043793CA677680
picc-generation: EV1
picc-storage: 2048
picc-key-settings-1: 0F
picc-key-settings-2: 01
picc-auth-mode: ISO
picc-key-len: 16
picc-key: 00000000000000000000000000000000

scan
inject-random C202FDE82ACBBE10
exchange native-apdu 901A0000010000 => EE4E607898C489F191AF
exchange native-apdu 90AF00001051BECDB4F15857C0643EAE21433F5F3C00 => A8D89558BE600CD49100
exchange native-apdu 905C00000900C35030C533F9E9E100 => A7C7654582E092099100
